{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QuarkState.ChiralityPairBit","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QuarkState.ChiralityPairBit","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.QuarkState.HelicityCommonSource"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.iotaVertex_eq_vertex","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.iotaVertex_eq_vertex","kind":"theorem","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/ChiralityPairBit.lean#L53-L56","doc":"The swapped letters are still Hecke letters at `q`, so `ι(V)` is a vertex of the\nsame algebra at the same parameter: it is `vertex q (swap q s) (swap q t)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.iota_vertex_pow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.iota_vertex_pow","kind":"theorem","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/ChiralityPairBit.lean#L48-L51","doc":"The same holds for every power of the vertex, e.g. `ι(VVV) = V̄V̄V̄`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.iota_vertex","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.iota_vertex","kind":"theorem","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/ChiralityPairBit.lean#L41-L46","doc":"**On a pair, the chirality swap is the orientation flip:** `ι(V) = V̄`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.iotaVertex","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.iotaVertex","kind":"def","line":38,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/ChiralityPairBit.lean#L38-L39","doc":"The chirality swap extended letterwise to a vertex: `ι(s) · ι(t)⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.mirrorVertex","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.mirrorVertex","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/ChiralityPairBit.lean#L35-L36","doc":"The mirror vertex `V̄ = s⁻¹ · t`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.vertex","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.Helicity.vertex","kind":"def","line":32,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/ChiralityPairBit.lean#L32-L33","doc":"The γγ vertex `V = s · t⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}